WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.847
Whop Checkout adds payment buttons and embedded payments to
your

00:00:03.847 --> 00:00:07.694
Webflow site. This walkthrough shows the installed Designer
extension, its

00:00:07.694 --> 00:00:11.541
connection flow, and the published sandbox demo. All app
features

00:00:11.541 --> 00:00:15.388
are free; separate Webflow and Whop service charges may apply.

00:00:16.038 --> 00:00:19.804
Open Apps in the Webflow Designer, select Whop Checkout, and

00:00:19.804 --> 00:00:23.571
choose Launch App. The orange checkout-card icon identifies
the current

00:00:23.571 --> 00:00:27.337
release. The app follows your device appearance automatically.
Its controls

00:00:27.337 --> 00:00:30.727
stay inside the Designer while you build your page.

00:00:31.377 --> 00:00:34.903
For embedded checkout, choose Connect Webflow. Webflow shows
the identity,

00:00:34.903 --> 00:00:38.429
site and custom-code access the app needs. Select the site

00:00:38.429 --> 00:00:41.955
you want to connect. The app uses Webflow OAuth and

00:00:41.955 --> 00:00:45.481
does not ask for your Webflow password or a Whop

00:00:45.481 --> 00:00:46.539
merchant API key.

00:00:47.189 --> 00:00:50.787
A user can cancel the authorization request. The app returns

00:00:50.787 --> 00:00:54.386
a clear cancellation message. No connection is created by
declining

00:00:54.386 --> 00:00:57.984
this request. Open Connect Webflow again when you are ready

00:00:57.984 --> 00:01:00.143
to approve access for your site.

00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:04.620
Approve access to the selected site. Webflow returns to the

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:08.447
connected page on the app website. Back in the Designer,

00:01:08.447 --> 00:01:12.274
choose Check connection. The backend verifies your current
Designer identity

00:01:12.274 --> 00:01:14.570
and site before allowing checkout-script changes.

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:18.564
For a button, select Checkout button and choose Sandbox or

00:01:18.564 --> 00:01:21.908
Production to match your Whop plan. Paste the plan ID

00:01:21.908 --> 00:01:25.251
or checkout link and enter the button label. Select a

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:28.595
container on your page, then choose Add checkout button. The

00:01:28.595 --> 00:01:31.604
native element can be styled with normal Webflow controls.

00:01:32.254 --> 00:01:35.992
Select a checkout created by this app and choose Load

00:01:35.992 --> 00:01:39.731
selected. Its current plan, environment and appearance are
loaded into

00:01:39.731 --> 00:01:43.469
the panel. Make your changes, then choose Update selected.
Existing

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:47.207
merchant styling is preserved when the app updates checkout
settings.

00:01:47.857 --> 00:01:51.416
Choose Embedded checkout to place Whop payment fields in your

00:01:51.416 --> 00:01:54.976
page. Select light, dark or device appearance for the customer

00:01:54.976 --> 00:01:58.535
checkout. This setting controls the payment form independently
of the

00:01:58.535 --> 00:02:02.094
app interface. A return URL is optional for handling payment

00:02:02.094 --> 00:02:03.874
outcomes on your own page.

00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:08.581
Enable embedded checkout after connecting your site. The
backend registers

00:02:08.581 --> 00:02:12.638
a versioned checkout runtime and installs it through the
Custom

00:02:12.638 --> 00:02:16.695
Code API, preserving other site scripts. Publish your Webflow
site

00:02:16.695 --> 00:02:20.752
to apply installation or removal. Previously published runtime
files remain

00:02:20.752 --> 00:02:22.375
available for existing sites.

00:02:23.025 --> 00:02:26.911
This is the published sandbox demo. Whop supplies the product

00:02:26.911 --> 00:02:30.797
price, payment methods and secure payment fields. The Webflow
app

00:02:30.797 --> 00:02:34.683
does not receive card details. Merchant payments are processed
by

00:02:34.683 --> 00:02:38.569
Whop; the integration does not create Webflow Ecommerce orders
or

00:02:38.569 --> 00:02:40.512
restrict access to Webflow pages.

00:02:41.162 --> 00:02:44.666
To remove the integration, expand Remove integration and
choose Remove

00:02:44.666 --> 00:02:48.169
scripts and disconnect. This removes the app’s applied runtime
and

00:02:48.169 --> 00:02:51.673
stored site connection. Publish afterward to remove the script
from

00:02:51.673 --> 00:02:55.176
the live site, then remove checkout elements you no longer

00:02:55.176 --> 00:02:56.928
want and uninstall the app.

00:02:57.578 --> 00:03:01.744
Setup instructions, privacy information, terms and source code
are linked

00:03:01.744 --> 00:03:05.909
from the app. The documentation covers connection, checkout
configuration, publishing

00:03:05.909 --> 00:03:10.075
and removal. Reviewers can use their own Webflow session and

00:03:10.075 --> 00:03:14.241
the supplied sandbox plan; no separate app account or paid

00:03:14.241 --> 00:03:15.491
tier is required.
